Implements the Tsetlin Machine, Embedding Tsetlin Machine, Convolutional Tsetlin Machine, Regression Tsetlin Machine, and Weighted Tsetlin Machine, with support for continuous features, multigranularity, clause indexing, drop clause/literal, and literal budget.
